// About us
section#about.section.section-lg.bg-transparent.text-center.text-md-start
	.container
		.row.row-30.justify-content-center.justify-content-md-between.align-items-center.align-items-xl-start
			.col-sm-10.col-md-6
				.img-responsive
					+img( 'home-08-630x840' )
			.col-sm-10.col-md-5
				.title-custom( data-animate!={ class: 'fadeInRight' } ) about us
				h2( data-animate!={ class: 'fadeInRight', delay: '.1s' } ) Delivering first-class construction services since 1950
				p( data-animate!={ class: 'fadeInRight', delay: '.2s' } ) Lintense is a North America-based, international construction services company and is a leading builder in diverse market segments.
				p( data-animate!={ class: 'fadeInRight', delay: '.3s' } ) The company has earned recognition for undertaking large, complex projects, fostering innovation, embracing emerging technologies, and making a difference for its clients, employees, and community. We complete $10 billion of construction on 1,500 projects each year.
				+img( 'home-09-410x304' ).d-none.d-xl-inline( data-animate!={ class: 'fadeInRight', delay: '.4s' } )